' processing/launcher.py; launcher_models.py; launcher_aws.py
title UC-6 design: launcher capacity records
top to bottom direction
class "launcher" as l <<module>> $PROC {
 tick(factory, ecs, queue, config, *,\nlaunching=True)
 _reserve(factory, config, obs, visible, *,\nlaunching)
 _send(factory, ecs, token, config=None)
}
class LauncherConfig $PROC {
 cap: int = 3
 lifetime_seconds: int = 1800
 always_on: bool = False
 slots: int {property}
}
class LauncherControl $PROC {
 id: int = 1
 enabled: bool
 session_end_at: datetime | None
}
class LaunchReservation $PROC {
 token: str
 started_by: str
 status: str
 payload: dict
 deadline_at: datetime
 task_arn: str | None
}
l --> LauncherConfig : reads
l --> LauncherControl : locks
l --> LaunchReservation : persists
LauncherControl "1" -- "0..*" LaunchReservation
note bottom of LaunchReservation
 token PK; started_by UNIQUE.
 Application association; no control FK.
 Selected fields; implicit self omitted.
 Cloud ports appear in the sequences.
end note
@enduml
